# Domain docs

This repo is single-context.

- `GLOSSARY.md` at the repo root defines canonical domain terms. Check it before inventing vocabulary; challenge terms in conversation that conflict with it.
- `docs/adr/` holds Architecture Decision Records, numbered sequentially (`0001-*.md`, `0002-*.md`, ...). Read relevant ADRs before changing the area they cover; never delete one — supersede it with a new ADR.
- Create `GLOSSARY.md` lazily, when the first term is resolved. Create `docs/adr/` when the first ADR is needed.
